:: b3 [b3 cascade-village map]
<div class='flex-row flex items-center gap-lg'>
  <div class='explore-box'>
    <h3>EXPLORE</h3>
    <ul class='choices'>
      <li>[[Look around->b3: description]]</li>
      <li>[[Stop at home.->b3: home]]</li>
      <li>[[Visit the Mergimal Lab->b3: lab]]</li>
      <li>[[Go to the beach.->b3: beach]]</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <<map 'b3'>><<s>><</map>><<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition = 'b3'>>
</div>

:: b3: description [b3 cascade-village description]
<div class='flex-row flex items-center gap-lg'>
  <img class='concept' src='images/story/cascade-village.png'>
  <div>
    <p>Cascade Village rests quietly on the sandy shores of Ho’onui Peninsula, where five cozy homes overlook the sparkling waves. The Mergimal Research Center stands at the edge of the beach, its sleek design contrasting with the warm, rustic charm of the village.</p>
    <p>Life moves at a gentle pace here, with the ocean breeze carrying the sound of laughter and the faint scent of salt and fresh bread. It’s a peaceful place to live—but for those eager to explore, Cascade Village feels like the calm before an unforgettable adventure.</p>
    <ul class='choices'>
      <li>[[Keep exploring the village.->$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition]]</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

:: b3: home [b3 cascade-village home]
<p>This is your home. The cozy warmth tempts you to stay, but you know that adventure calls.</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Continue exploring.->$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition]]</li>
</ul>

:: b3: lab [b3 cascade-village lab]
<p>This is the world-famous Mergimal Research Center. It is also the home of your mentor, Professor Tamarack.</p>
<p>If you want, you can see if he’s available to talk.</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>
    <<link 'Tell him about the delivery. (requires: keyword DELIVERY)'>>
      <<if !$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].keywords.includes('delivery')>>
        <<dialog 'no keyword DELIVERY'>>
          <<include 'no keyword'>>
        <</dialog>>
      <<else>>
        <<goto 'tamarack: delivery'>>
      <</if>>
    <</link>>
  </li>
  <li>[[Keep exploring the village.->$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition]]</li>
</ul>

:: b3: beach [b3 cascade-village beach]
<p>The beach is small, but tidy. If you knew how to ride a Mergimal, you could go out on the water.</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>
    <<link 'Brave the waters (requires: keyword PADDLE)'>>
      <<if !$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].keywords.includes('paddle')>>
        <<dialog 'no keyword paddle'>>
          <<include 'no paddle'>>
        <</dialog>>
      <<else>>
        <<goto 'b3: out to sea'>>
      <</if>>
    <</link>>
  </li>
  <li>[[Keep exploring the village.->$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition]]</li>
</ul>

:: b3: out to sea [b3 cascade-village paddle]
<p>(Keyword PADDLE detected)</p>
<p>The water is great.</p>
<p>Skip count by d12, d12 times.</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Success.->b5]]</li>
  <li>[[Failure.->404]]</li>
</ul>

:: tamarack: delivery [b3 cascade-village lab]
<<tam>>Grace wasn't at the Veil School?<br />
And it was closed?<br />
How odd!<br />
Perhaps you'll have to start your Mergimal challenge in Blue Urf or Raven Wing instead.<br />
<p>Oh, and you have a delivery for me?</p>
<p>Excellent! I’ve been waiting for these Mergiballs.</p>
<p>As long as you're here, I'd love to give you some tips on how to use these things out in the wild.</p>
<</tam>>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Sure, tell me more.->tamarack: tips]]</li>
  <li>[[Nah, I’m good. Thanks.->$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition]]</li>
</ul>

:: tamarack: tips [b3 cascade-village lab]